WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
Why should we be able to arrive in the afternoon?

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,800
Let's take action early tomorrow morning after a night's rest.

3
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:05,700
When the afternoon arrives, you can go directly to the palace.

4
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:07,500
Does anyone know what the conditions are like at Jiang Hua’s base?

5
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:08,800
The bed is definitely not as comfortable as mine

6
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:10,500
Complete the acquisition quickly

7
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:11,900
This girl has to rush back

8
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:14,800
Let’s reward the sisters for the funny fun of these stupid pigs in Jianghua.

9
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:17,200
Jiang Hua Clan will send people to assist us

10
00:00:18,110 --> 00:00:20,010
I will discuss tactics with them in the afternoon.

11
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:23,280
You also need to meet face to face with everyone in the know to understand the target situation.

12
00:00:24,440 --> 00:00:26,740
It’s said that the minister takes this operation too seriously.

13
00:00:26,740 --> 00:00:28,040
Sent four of us

14
00:00:28,240 --> 00:00:30,040
I think two people at most are enough

15
00:00:30,440 --> 00:00:32,140
If the reality in the video is lost

16
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:33,840
The minister's decision is not an exaggeration

17
00:00:34,240 --> 00:00:36,240
Jin Lian has never encountered such a mutant species.

18
00:00:37,390 --> 00:00:38,790
If the other party can grow

19
00:00:39,290 --> 00:00:41,890
Our goal is to nip it in the cradle

20
00:00:42,190 --> 00:00:46,330
Brothers, remember to let me have fun. I'll take a nap first.

21
00:00:46,430 --> 00:00:47,430
Remember to call me when you arrive
